@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### 1) Tanpa token - harus 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "participant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 2) Login user A
# simpan token dari response ke bearer_a
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rina.prameswari@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2a) Ambil profil peserta A (buat participant_id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/participants/me
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_a}}

### 2b) Ambil event (event slug di list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?size=1

### 3) Login user B
# simpan token dari response ke bearer_b
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joel.lim@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4) Buat registrasi dengan user A
# gunakan event_id dari 2b dan participant_id dari 2a
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_a}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": "<EVENT_ID_FROM_STEP_2b>",
  "participant_id": "<PARTICIPANT_ID_FROM_STEP_2a>",
  "ticket_type_id": null,
  "dietary_preference": "Vegetarian",
  "accessibility_requirements": null,
  "emergency_contact_name": "Budi",
  "emergency_contact_phone": "+628123",
  "consent_snapshot": "{}"
}

### 5) User A lihat detail registrasi (ganti <REGISTRATION_ID_USER_A>)
GET {{baseUrl}}/registrations/<REGISTRATION_ID_USER_A>
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_a}}

### 6) User B coba akses registrasi user A (harus 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/registrations/<REGISTRATION_ID_USER_A>
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_b}}

### 7) User A list semua registrasinya
GET {{baseUrl}}/registrations/me
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_a}}

### 8) User A dengan format ID tidak valid (harus 422)
GET {{baseUrl}}/registrations/invalid-id
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_a}}
